<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LGF Consultant | Sites, Automação & Consultoria Estratégica de TI</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Transforme a TI da sua empresa num motor de crescimento. Sites de alta conversão, automação de processos e consultoria técnica especializada.">
    
    <!-- Google Fonts & FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Montserrat:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        /* ==========================================================================
           1. VARIÁVEIS DE DESIGN & RESET (IDENTIDADE VISUAL LGF)
           ========================================================================== */
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #070b19;
            --bg-navy: #0b132b;
            --bg-card: #111b38;
            --bg-card-light: #ffffff;
            --accent-purple: #6d28d9;
            --accent-magenta: #a855f7;
            --accent-cyan: #00e5ff;
            --accent-cyan-hover: #00b8d4;
            --text-white: #ffffff;
            --text-light: #e2e8f0;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --text-dark: #0f172a;
            --gradient-hero: linear-gradient(135deg, #070b19 0%, #1c0a35 60%, #0b132b 100%);
            --gradient-purple: linear-gradient(135deg, #6d28d9 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            --gradient-cyan: linear-gradient(135deg, #00e5ff 0%, #00b8d4 100%);
            --shadow-glow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.25);
            --radius-sm: 8px;
            --radius-md: 12px;
            --radius-lg: 20px;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-light);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        .section-padding {
            padding: 90px 0;
        }

        .text-cyan { color: var(--accent-cyan); }
        .text-gradient {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, var(--accent-cyan) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        /* ==========================================================================
           2. HEADER & NAVEGAÇÃO
           ========================================================================== */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(7, 11, 25, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 18px 0;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        .logo-icon {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            background: var(--gradient-cyan);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 32px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-light);
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .btn-header {
            background: var(--gradient-purple);
            color: var(--text-white);
            padding: 10px 22px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-header:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.6);
        }

        /* ==========================================================================
           3. SECÇÃO 1: HERO SECTION
           ========================================================================== */
        .hero {
            background: var(--gradient-hero);
            padding: 160px 0 100px;
            position: relative;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 44px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.25;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Formulário Rápido */
        .hero-form-box {
            background: rgba(17, 27, 56, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
        }

        .hero-form-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        .hero-form-fields {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .form-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            color: var(--text-white);
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .form-input:focus {
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .btn-cyan {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            border: none;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .btn-cyan:hover {
            background: var(--accent-cyan-hover);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .hero-social-proof {
            margin-top: 24px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .hero-social-proof i {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        /* Visual Hero (Ilustração de TI) */
        .hero-visual {
            position: relative;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-visual img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 460px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            border: 2px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        /* ==========================================================================
           4. SECÇÃO 2: AGITAÇÃO DA DOR (COMPARATIVO)
           ========================================================================== */
        .compare-section {
            background: var(--bg-navy);
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 60px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .section-subtitle {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .compare-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .compare-card {
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        .compare-card.bad {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.05);
            border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
        }

        .compare-card.good {
            background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.05);
            border-color: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
        }

        .compare-card-title {
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .compare-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .compare-item {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 14px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .compare-item i {
            margin-top: 4px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .bad .compare-item i { color: #ef4444; }
        .good .compare-item i { color: var(--accent-cyan); }

        /* ==========================================================================
           5. SECÇÃO 3: ECOSSISTEMA DE SOLUÇÕES LGF
           ========================================================================== */
        .solutions-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .solution-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 36px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .solution-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
        }

        .solution-icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-purple);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 26px;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .solution-title {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .solution-desc {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ==========================================================================
           6. SECÇÃO 4: CONHECIMENTO & SEO EDUCATIVO (FAQ ACCORDION)
           ========================================================================== */
        .seo-section {
            background: var(--bg-navy);
        }

        .faq-wrapper {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .faq-item {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .faq-question {
            padding: 20px 24px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-white);
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .faq-question:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        }

        .faq-answer {
            padding: 0 24px 20px;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            display: none;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .faq-item.active .faq-answer {
            display: block;
        }

        .faq-item.active .faq-question i {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        /* ==========================================================================
           7. SECÇÃO 5: CASOS DE ESTUDO, DEPOIMENTOS & GOOGLE NEGÓCIO
           ========================================================================== */
        .cases-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .case-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
        }

        .case-stat {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* Widget Placeholder: Google Meu Negócio & Depoimentos */
        .reviews-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .google-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #000000;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .stars {
            color: #fbc02d;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        /* ==========================================================================
           8. SECÇÃO 6: OFERTA PRINCIPAL & FORMULÁRIO COMPLETO
           ========================================================================== */
        .offer-section {
            background: var(--gradient-hero);
            position: relative;
        }

        .offer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 50px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .offer-form-container {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
        }

        .form-group-full {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .form-label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .form-select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            color: var(--text-white);
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
        }

        .form-select option {
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        /* Trust Badges */
        .trust-badges {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .badge-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* ==========================================================================
           9. SECÇÃO SOCIAL: INSTAGRAM & REDES
           ========================================================================== */
        .social-section {
            background: var(--bg-navy);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .instagram-placeholder {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .insta-box {
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .insta-box:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-magenta);
            color: var(--accent-magenta);
        }

        /* ==========================================================================
           10. BOTÃO FLUTUANTE WHATSAPP & RODAPÉ
           ========================================================================== */
        .whatsapp-float {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 24px;
            right: 24px;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: #25d366;
            color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.5);
            z-index: 9999;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .whatsapp-float:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.7);
        }

        footer {
            background: #040711;
            padding: 40px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* ==========================================================================
           11. RESPONSIVIDADE (MOBILE & TABLET)
           ========================================================================== */
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .hero-grid, .compare-grid, .solutions-grid, .cases-grid, .offer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .hero-title { font-size: 32px; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .instagram-placeholder { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .hero-form-fields { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ==========================================================================
       HEADER
       ========================================================================== -->
    <header>
        <div class="container nav-wrapper">
            <a href="#" class="logo">
                <div class="logo-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i></div>
                <span>LGF <small style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent-cyan);">Consultant</small></span>
            </a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#solucoes">Soluções</a></li>
                <li><a href="#comparativo">Diferenciais</a></li>
                <li><a href="#faq">Estratégia SEO</a></li>
                <li><a href="#casos">Resultados</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contato">Contacto</a></li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#contato" class="btn-header">Solicite sua Proposta</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ==========================================================================
       SECÇÃO 1: HERO SECTION
       ========================================================================== -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
            <div>
                <div class="hero-badge">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Consultoria Estratégica & Tecnologia para PMEs
                </div>
                <h1 class="hero-title">
                    Transforme a TI da sua empresa de um centro de custos em uma <span class="text-gradient">máquina de crescimento</span>.
                </h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">
                    Criamos sites institucionais de alto impacto, automatizamos processos manuais e blindamos sua operação com consultoria técnica especializada.
                </p>

                <!-- Formulário Rápido de 2 Campos -->
                <div class="hero-form-box">
                    <div class="hero-form-title">⚡ Receba um Diagnóstico de TI Gratuito</div>
                    
                    <!-- FORMULÁRIO DE CAPTURA RÁPIDA (INTEGRÁVEL COM A HOSTINGER) -->
                    <form action="SEU_LINK_ACTION_HOSTINGER_AQUI" method="POST">
                        <div class="hero-form-fields">
                            <input type="email" name="email" class="form-input" placeholder="Seu E-mail Corporativo" required>
                            <input type="tel" name="whatsapp" class="form-input" placeholder="Seu WhatsApp (com DDD)" required>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn-cyan">
                            Quero meu Diagnóstico de TI Gratuito →
                        </button>
                    </form>

                    <div class="hero-social-proof">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                        <span>Mais de 50+ operações otimizadas | 99.8% de tempo de atividade garantido</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Visual da Marca -->
            <div class="hero-visual">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Equipa LGF Consultant em Reunião Estratégica">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================================================
       SECÇÃO 2: AGITAÇÃO DA DOR (COMPARATIVO)
       ========================================================================== -->
    <section class="section-padding compare-section" id="comparativo">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2 class="section-title">O Custo de Não Ter uma TI Estratégica</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">Veja a diferença entre continuar improvisando ou ter a LGF Consultant ao seu lado.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="compare-grid">
                <!-- Sem LGF -->
                <div class="compare-card bad">
                    <div class="compare-card-title text-white">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation" style="color: #ef4444;"></i>
                        Cenário Atual (Sem Estratégia)
                    </div>
                    <ul class="compare-list">
                        <li class="compare-item">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
                            <div><strong>Site antigo ou inexistente:</strong> Perde clientes para concorrentes com presença digital mais moderna.</div>
                        </li>
                        <li class="compare-item">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
                            <div><strong>Equipa presa em tarefas repetitivas:</strong> Dezenas de horas gastas com planilhas e digitação manual.</div>
                        </li>
                        <li class="compare-item">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
                            <div><strong>Insegurança e Vulnerabilidade:</strong> Risco de perda de dados cruciais, ciberataques e paralisação do negócio.</div>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Com LGF -->
                <div class="compare-card good">
                    <div class="compare-card-title text-cyan">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                        Cenário com a LGF Consultant
                    </div>
                    <ul class="compare-list">
                        <li class="compare-item">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                            <div><strong>Presença Digital de Elite:</strong> Site ultra-rápido, otimizado para SEO e focado em converter visitantes em vendas.</div>
                        </li>
                        <li class="compare-item">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                            <div><strong>Processos Automatizados:</strong> Integração entre CRM, ERP e WhatsApp operando 24/7 sem erros humanos.</div>
                        </li>
                        <li class="compare-item">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                            <div><strong>Infraestrutura Blindada:</strong> Consultoria contínua, backups automáticos e protocolos de segurança avançados.</div>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================================================
       SECÇÃO 3: ECOSSISTEMA DE SOLUÇÕES LGF
       ========================================================================== -->
    <section class="section-padding" id="solucoes">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2 class="section-title">Soluções Projetadas para o Seu Crescimento</h2>
